--- !u!114 &324432602
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 324432601}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2a399ced64b134d65a0ff1f3a79ec2ce, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Mission
  goal: 1
  help: 'LONG SHOT. A test range for the spinal railgun, the gun on your nose. The
    Garuda patrols east and west, north of you. It doesn''t hunt you. Destroy it
    with the railgun.

    1. Press P. POWER (key 3): click ENG, SEN and WEP to DRAW.

    2.
    ORDERS: click the alert once, from C3 to C2.

    3. SENSORS (key 2): turn on
    DRADIS. Fly north until a red bar shows the Garuda.

    4. Find its course:
    ACTIVE SCAN, or POINT and RULER once it is in sight.

    5. Stop the ship. A
    drifting ship''s shot drifts too.

    6. FIRE CONTROL (key 1): a line runs out
    of the nose. With the railgun picked, the RULER shows how long the slug takes.

    7.
    Turn the nose onto where the Garuda will be. Shift with A or D turns slowly.

    8.
    Set the four switches and pull the lever.'
  drill: []
  jumpPoint: {fileID: 0}
  weaponsOff: 0
